xt","url":"/docs/components/card#link","content":"Link to billing, domain search, or hosting from the whole Card. Keep nested controls out of\nstandalone link Cards."},"245":{"id":"/docs/components/card-25","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#grouped-links","content":"Open a domain's settings by pressing its Card or Enter. Toggle auto-renew or manage DNS without\nopening the Card. Arrow keys move between domains, skipping the domain being transferred."},"246":{"id":"/docs/components/card-26","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#media","content":"Preview website templates with inset, full bleed, or standalone media, and a brand palette\nwith custom media. Direct CornerActions place the favorite action over the template preview."},"247":{"id":"/docs/components/card-27","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#actions","content":"Open a newsletter signup from the Card, or save it without opening the form. Submit a valid\nemail to see a local confirmation."},"248":{"id":"/docs/components/card-28","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#multiple-selection","content":"Choose optional add-ons and see the monthly total update. The indicators show selection,\nincluding a custom text indicator for email."},"249":{"id":"/docs/components/card-29","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#single-selection","content":"Pick a plan and see its monthly price. `disallowEmptySelection` keeps one plan selected."},"250":{"id":"/docs/components/card-30","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#disabled","content":"Explain why billing or add-ons are unavailable. Disable an individual Card with `isDisabled`,\nor disable Cards by key with `disabledKeys` on the group."},"251":{"id":"/docs/components/card-31","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#layout","content":"A featured business guide and a responsive reading list. Grid adapts the layout to the\navailable space, while each guide keeps its own height."},"252":{"id":"/docs/components/card-32","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#customization","content":"Customize `CardSelectionIndicator` with non-interactive children or a selection-state render\nfunction. `CardGroup` owns selection, which works without an indicator."},"253":{"id":"/docs/components/card-33","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#customization","content":"Use `className` with `[data-selected]`, `[data-hovered]`, `[data-pressed]`, `[data-focus-visible]`,\nand `[data-disabled]` to style Card states."},"254":{"id":"/docs/components/card-34","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"Name `CardGroup` with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`, and set `textValue` on Cards with composed\ncontent for accessible names and typeahead."},"255":{"id":"/docs/components/card-35","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"`CardGroup` uses grid navigation: Tab enters or leaves, arrow keys move between Cards, and Space\nchanges selection. Enter activates row actions or links. Choose selection or `onAction`;\ncombining them prevents pointer selection."},"256":{"id":"/docs/components/card-36","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"Use `keyboardNavigationBehavior=\"tab\"` for nested controls. Antares controls keep their actions\nindependent of the Card; use `Pressable` for custom controls."},"257":{"id":"/docs/components/card-37","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessi