uring icon loading from CDN"},"739":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-76","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"},"740":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-77","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"},"741":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-78","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"},"742":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-79","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"The component also includes accessibility attributes:"},"743":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-80","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`role=\"presentation\"`: For decorative icons"},"744":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-81","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`role=\"img\"`: When title prop is provided"},"745":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-82","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#data-attributes","content":"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"},"746":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-83","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#inherit-from-parent-default","content":"By default, icons inherit the color from their parent element via `currentColor`:"},"747":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-84","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#explicit-colors","content":"Override the color with specific values:"},"748":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-85